        "level": 2,
        "text": "Put the code where it says 'Change the GET route'.\n\nIn server.js:\n```\n  if (match && req.method === \"GET\") return note && (note.owner === user.username || note.sharedWith.includes(user.username)) ? send(res, 200, note) : send(res, 404, { error: \"Note not found\" });\n```"
